          "text": "And they said \"Oh! It's Wolf Gang, \"Yonkers\", Goblin is my shit though\"",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Now I'm like, \"fuck, I don't want to be an asshole\"",
          "rhyme": "ol",
