        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "So fucking annoyed 'cause I missed Goliath",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "'Cause some kid said I was there, then they caused a riot (Tyler's here!)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Now I'm surrounded by a 25 hound of fuckers tryna get a photo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "All because they noticed the top with the box logo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And them fucking ears, guarantee they didn't even hear Bastard",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "They bandwagon-jumped me from a pogo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I'm going fucking loco, \"Hey, Tyler, can I...?\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "No, bitch, don't you see me tryna buy a fucking churro?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "\"But Tyler, you're my hero, I used to get bullied",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Until I heard \"Radicals,\" the last part got to me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "See, I used to give a fuck until my cock would bleed",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Now I'm the happiest I think I'll ever ever be",
          "rhyme": "ab",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "My life is just like yours, no father",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "My momma must have forgot to stop with a popped condom",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "In school, I was the one that was thinking outside boxes",
          "rhyme": "Oks",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "So everybody in them would say that I got problems",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "So when I heard you say it, I said it back like fuck 'em",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "You're an inspiration to niggas like me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Not the niggas who just like you 'cause of lyrics and beats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "I'm talking 'bout the niggas who don't know where they're going to be",
          "rhyme": "ab",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "I heard the song \"Bastard\" right in the moment of heat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Not in summer, but of course, I was holding a heat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Gun on the edge of my feet, I heard that first piano chord",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "And it drew me in like predators carrying treats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Then I said to myself, \"Fuck, is he speaking to me?\"",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "See, me and you, we go together like snare and a beat",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "I mean snare and a kick drum, see my forearm?",
