          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "That's hard, that scar from playing air guitar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "When I see you play at the Roxy (Uhh)",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Tyler, I love you, wanna be just like you (Alright)",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "I think about your face and I don't even fucking try to (No homo)",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_wolf_haley"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Wish I had a basement meant for me to hide you",
          "rhyme": "u",
